<h1>Apprenticeships Most People Don't Think About</h1>

<p>
When people hear "apprenticeship," they often think electrician,
plumber, or construction worker. The modern apprenticeship system
is much larger. Registered Apprenticeship spans more than 1,000
occupations, including technology, healthcare, finance, manufacturing,
energy, transportation, education, and agriculture.
</p>

<div class="notice">
<strong>Important:</strong> An occupation being approved for Registered
Apprenticeship does not mean an opening exists in your area today.
Use the official Apprenticeship Finder to verify current openings,
employers, sponsors, locations, and requirements.
</div>

</section>


