<h2>Application Process</h2>
<p>
Treat apprenticeship hunting like a research project instead of
waiting for one perfect job posting.
</p>
</div>

<div class="steps">

<div class="step">
<div class="step-number">01 — EXPLORE</div>
<h3>Pick 3 Industries</h3>
<p>Choose industries that match your interests, strengths, and realistic entry point.</p>
</div>

<div class="step">
<div class="step-number">02 — EXPAND</div>
<h3>Find Occupations</h3>
<p>Search multiple job titles instead of searching only for "apprentice."</p>
</div>

<div class="step">
<div class="step-number">03 — VERIFY</div>
<h3>Check the Program</h3>
<p>Confirm the employer, sponsor, location, requirements, pay structure, and training.</p>
</div>

<div class="step">
<div class="step-number">04 — APPLY</div>
<h3>Build a Pipeline</h3>
<p>Apply to multiple legitimate opportunities and track every application.</p>
</div>

</div>

