<section class="section">

<div class="section-heading">
<h2>What Makes a Registered Apprenticeship Different?</h2>
<p>
The value isn't simply getting a job with the word "apprentice" in the title.
</p>
</div>

<div class="reality">

<div class="reality-card">
<h3>Paid Work</h3>
<p>Registered apprenticeships are jobs, with apprentices earning wages as they develop skills.</p>
</div>

<div class="reality-card">
<h3>Mentorship</h3>
<p>Training occurs under experienced workers rather than relying entirely on self-study.</p>
</div>

<div class="reality-card">
<h3>Education</h3>
<p>Programs include structured supplemental instruction connected to the occupation.</p>
</div>

<div class="reality-card">
<h3>Credential</h3>
<p>Registered apprentices can earn a portable, nationally recognized credential.</p>
</div>

</div>

